@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A6FA5
title Bool 输出约束的求值
start
:候选快照 = 请求的输出;
repeat
  :在同一个快照上求值\n所有 `require` / `mutex`;
  :收集被阻止的目标;
  :将被阻止的目标置为 false\n（绝不 false -> true）;
repeat while (快照有变化？) is (是)
->否;
:安全意图\n（与声明顺序无关）;
stop
@enduml
